t":false,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"d-uspenskiy","id":47734295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/d-uspenskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"d-uspenskiy","id":47734295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/d-uspenskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-05-25T05:35:12Z","updated_at":"2022-09-20T06:28:07Z","closed_at":"2022-06-28T17:53:49Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-540](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-540)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nIndex scan and FK check internally calls the `PgDocOp::PopulateDmlByYbctidOps` method. This method prepares read request with batch of ybctids. The value of the first ybctid is used for routing to particular tablet and it is written into the `ybctid_column_value` field of read request.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/master/src/yb/yql/pggate/pg_doc_op.cc#L597\r\n\r\nUsing of the first ybctid from unsorted list of ybctids might be a problem due to dynamic splitting.\r\n\r\nSuppose particular table has single tablet and the following ybctids was returned by the index: `ybctid_4, ybctid_3, ybctid_1, ybctid_5, ybctid_6` (hash index doesn't guarantee rows order).\r\nYSQL prepares read request and set the value of `ybctid_column_value` field to `ybctid_4` (the first ybctid in the list).\r\nAt this point DocDB initiate table split and table got split onto 2 tablets (-INF, ybctid_3), [ybctid_4, +INF).\r\nPrepared read request will go to tablet 2 as a result the row for `ybctid_1` and `ybctid_3` will not be read as they are placed into tablet 1.\r\n\r\nPossible solution:\r\nThe value of minimal ybctid from the list must be set to `ybctid_column_value` and not the first one. \r\n \r\n\r\n   ","closed_by":{"login":"d-uspenskiy","id":47734295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/d-uspenskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12648/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}